synopsis: Acquire/release semaphore tokens more readily
description:
  GHC now acquires semaphore tokens more readily: for as long as there is
  outstanding work, it takes tokens as fast as the semaphore supplies them,
  instead of about one token per second.

  The release debounce period was also considerably shortened, from 1s to 10ms.

  With :ghc-flag:`-jsem`, the number of capabilities is now capped at the number
  of processors, as it already is for :ghc-flag:`-j[⟨n⟩]`.
